<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for contacting Admission Services at Arizona State University. We have received your recent request to waive our application fee. Unfortunately, we are unable to approve your request. Application fee waivers are available only for applicants who are Arizona residents, currently attending high school and who will be first-time freshmen at ASU.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">This fee is required to process your application. We will await payment prior to any further processing. If you have any questions, please contact me at&nbsp;</font>{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Recruiter_Email__c}<font face="arial">. I am your personal contact for admission-related questions, and I’ll be happy to help you through the admission process.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: Times; font-size: medium;"><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Pone__c}</font></div></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>